@AppleSupport ie: on my mac. log in. 2FA code displays on my Mac. Should it not only show on a secondary device?
@208634 We're here for you. The code displays on trusted devices only. Check out this article for more info: https://t.co/RONuUjClwW
@AppleSupport If the code appears on the same device as the one with the user ID and the password, then anyone can gain access.
@208634 Yes, the code should appear on a device marked as "trusted." This is the standard design of two-factor authentication.

